SUMMARY:Slow Looking: Jameisha Prescod on Frida Kahlo
DESCRIPTION:Jameisha Prescod discusses Frida Kahlo's art and the lives of
  disabled artists. An out-of-hours exhibition visit follows the talk.\nP
 rice: £40 / £13 for Members\; £36 Concessions / £10 Universal or Pen
 sion Credit recipients\; £10 for Tate Collective\; Livestream only tick
 et £8\nhttps://www.tate.org.uk/whats-on/tate-modern/frida-kahlo-the-mak
 ing-of-an-icon/frida-kahlo
